<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/nav') %><main class="container page-pad"><div class="page-intro"><span class="section-kicker">CURRICULUM MANAGER</span><h1>Kelola Modul</h1><p class="muted">Seluruh topik dari materi foto tercatat. Publikasikan modul hanya setelah tersedia minimal satu materi terbit.</p></div><%- include('../partials/adminnav') %><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="panel table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Modul</th><th>Materi terbit</th><th>Status</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><% mods.forEach(m=>{ %><tr><td><strong><%= m.title %></strong><br><small class="muted"><%= m.slug %></small></td><td><%= m.published_lessons %></td><td><span class="status-pill <%= m.is_published?'published':'' %>"><%= m.is_published?'Published':'Draft' %></span></td><td><form action="/admin/modules/<%= m.id %>/toggle" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-dark"><%= m.is_published?'Jadikan Draft':'Publikasikan' %></button></form></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="panel p-4"><h4>Tambah Modul</h4><p class="muted small">Modul baru dimulai dengan status Draft.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/modules/new"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><div class="mb-3"><label for="slug" class="form-label">Slug URL</label><input class="form-control" id="slug" name="slug" pattern="[a-z0-9-]{3,80}" placeholder="past-continuous" required></div><div class="mb-3"><label for="title" class="form-label">Judul</label><input class="form-control" id="title" name="title" required maxlength="160"></div><div class="mb-3"><label for="description" class="form-label">Deskripsi</label><textarea class="form-control" id="description" name="description" rows="3"></textarea></div><button class="btn btn-brand" type="submit">Buat Modul</button></form></div></div></div></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
